<%@ taglib prefix="seal" uri="https://arte.or.kr/seal/functions" %>
<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>동의 수신자 상세</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/resources/css/admin-data.css?v=20260906-3"></head>
<body class="admin-body"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/header.jsp"/><div class="admin-layout"><jsp:include page="/WEB-INF/jsp/fragments/admin/sidebar.jsp"/><main class="admin-main"><div class="page-heading-row"><div><p class="section-kicker">RECIPIENT DETAIL</p><h1><c:out value="${recipient.maskedName()}"/></h1><p>개인정보 동의 요청 이메일을 받을 수신자 정보입니다. 이름과 이메일 원문은 다시 표시하지 않습니다.</p></div><c:if test="${recipient.status() != 'DESTROYED'}"><a class="primary-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients/${recipient.recipientId()}/edit">수정</a></c:if></div>
<section class="work-panel"><dl class="detail-list"><div><dt>수신자 소속기관</dt><dd><c:out value="${empty recipient.affiliationName() ? '미입력' : recipient.affiliationName()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>수신자 직책</dt><dd><c:out value="${empty recipient.jobTitle() ? '미입력' : recipient.jobTitle()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>이름</dt><dd><c:out value="${recipient.maskedName()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>이메일</dt><dd><c:out value="${recipient.maskedEmail()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>수신자 정보<br/>등록 근거</dt><dd><c:out value="${recipient.collectionBasis()}"/></dd></div><div><dt>상태</dt><dd><c:out value="${seal:statusLabel('recipient', recipient.status())}"/></dd></div></dl></section>
<c:if test="${recipient.status() != 'DESTROYED'}"><section class="work-panel action-panel"><form method="post" action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/recipients/${recipient.recipientId()}/status"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="versionNo" value="${recipient.versionNo()}"><input type="hidden" name="status" value="${recipient.status() == 'ACTIVE' ? 'INACTIVE' : 'ACTIVE'}"><button class="secondary-button" type="submit">${recipient.status() == 'ACTIVE' ? '비활성화' : '재활성화'}</button></form></section></c:if></main></div></body></html>
